 4411: /// Asks the injected [MediaResolver] (if any) to render [rc.block]. Returns
 4412: /// `null` when no resolver is injected, the resolver declines (`null`), or the
 4413: /// resolver throws — in all those cases the caller falls back to the built-in
 4414: /// placeholder. The try/catch keeps a faulty resolver from crashing the editor
 4415: /// (see `docs/schema_and_commands.md` §Error handling).
 4416: Widget? _resolveMedia(BuildContext context, BlockRenderContext rc) {
 4417:   final resolver = rc.mediaResolver;
 4418:   if (resolver == null) {
 4419:     return null;
 4420:   }
 4421:   try {
 4422:     return resolver.resolve(context, rc.block);
 4423:   } on Object catch (error) {
 4424:     FlutterError.reportError(FlutterErrorDetails(
 4425:       exception: error,
 4426:       library: 'wenz_richtext',
 4427:       context: ErrorDescription('MediaResolver.resolve threw for block '
 4428:           '${rc.block.id} (${rc.block.type}); falling back to placeholder.'),
 4429:     ));
 4430:     return null;
 4431:   }
 4432: }
